# Template for "too many who-are-you loops" branches.
# Copy this title into any dialogue file and redirect to it from your loop.
# Replace the final "=> END" with a target title after copying, if needed.

~ who_are_you_loop_break_template
{{npc_name}}: ...
{{player_name}}: ...
{{npc_name}}: ...
{{player_name}}: Отдохнула?
{{npc_name}}: Да, продолжаем.
do reset_who_are_you_loop()
=> END
